WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.477
Pig's nose felt better.

2
00:00:15.478 --> 00:00:26.016
He went to do more good things.

3
00:00:26.017 --> 00:00:28.301
Cat was on the roof.

4
00:00:28.302 --> 00:00:31.990
She could not get down.

5
00:00:31.991 --> 00:00:35.634
"I will help you!" said Pig.

6
00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:45.551
"Jump onto me."

7
00:00:45.552 --> 00:00:49.300
So Cat jumped.

8
00:00:49.301 --> 00:00:52.972
But her claws dug into Pig's back.

9
00:00:52.973 --> 00:00:57.374
"Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!" yelled Pig.

10
00:00:57.375 --> 00:01:00.746
"Sorry, Pig!" Cat said.

11
00:01:00.747 --> 00:01:05.869
"But thanks for helping me."

12
00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.680
Pig ran back to the pond.

13
00:01:08.681 --> 00:01:12.581
Cat ran with him.

14
00:01:12.582 --> 00:01:16.358
Pig rolled in the cool, wet mud.

15
00:01:16.359 --> 00:01:19.974
"My nose hurts," said Pig.

16
00:01:19.975 --> 00:01:22.617
"My back hurts.

17
00:01:22.618 --> 00:01:29.627
I am not a very good Super Pig."

18
00:01:29.628 --> 00:01:34.196
"But you are a super friend," said Cow.

19
00:01:34.197 --> 00:01:37.084
"Yes," said Cat.

20
00:01:37.085 --> 00:01:51.548
"And that is much, much better!"

